# Purpose

This document defines the realtime engineering standards for the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to establish architectural principles for propagating business events across the platform while preserving consistency, scalability, and operational reliability.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Realtime philosophy
* Event propagation
* Synchronization principles
* Consistency model
* Realtime governance
* Realtime evolution

It intentionally excludes messaging technologies, transport protocols, platform-specific realtime services, and implementation-specific synchronization techniques, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to realtime communication, ensuring business events are distributed consistently while preserving architectural boundaries and business integrity.

